  "title": "Reach the beacon",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "md": "## Call, then see\n\n`Player.move` walks the fox one cell. The beacon stays put — you walk onto it.\n\n- `\"east\"` increases **x**\n- `\"south\"` increases **y**"
    },
    {
      "type": "predict",
      "id": "where-after-east",
      "promptMd": "The fox starts at (0, 0). After one `Player.move(\"east\")`, where is it?",
      "kind": "mcq",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "same",
          "md": "Still at (0, 0)"
        },
        {
          "id": "east",
          "md": "At (1, 0)"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "east"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "reach-beacon",
      "engine": "javascript",
      "entry": "main.js",
      "promptMd": "> Walk the fox onto the beacon at `(3, 2)`.",
